,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"We use deep convolutional neural networks to experiment semantic segmentation task on India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":288891,"global_rank":27984,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5839},{"name":"mykldggn/SolanaBOT","owner":"mykldggn","html_url":"https://github.com/mykldggn/SolanaBOT","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Shell code for a Solana Memecoin BOT, assuming the user has access to the paid API chosen as well as a Telegram copytrading bot. ","topics":[],"score":288871,"global_rank":27994,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5840},{"name":"FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","owner":"FredHutch","html_url":"https://github.com/FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","stars":10,"forks":3,"watchers":8,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":"Run Nextflow on AWS Batch (Squared)","topics":[],"score":288869,"global_rank":27995,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5841},{"name":"yangyuan/aiomcp","owner":"yangyuan","html_url":"https://github.com/yangyuan/aiomcp","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A Simple Python MCP Solution","topics":[],"s